==English==

===Noun===
{{head|en|noun|head=[[first]] [[base]]}}

# {{label|en|singulare tantum|baseball}} The base after home plate in a counter-clockwise path around a baseball [[infield]].
#: ''The [[runner]] took his [[lead]] off of '''first base'''.''
# {{label|en|singulare tantum|by extension}} Completion of the first phase of an activity.
# {{label|en|singulare tantum|US|colloquial}} Kissing, regarded as the first phase of a sexual relationship.
# {{lb|en|blackjack}} The betting spot located immediately to the left of the dealer, which is first to receive cards and first to act.

